{"version":1,"id":"dasha-austin","title":"Austin","artist":"Dasha","key":"Am","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/dasha/austin/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Adam Wendler, Anna Dasha Novotny, Cheyenne Rose Arnspiger and Kenneth Travis Heidelman","chords":[{"symbol":"Am","canonical":"Am","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,0,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F","canonical":"F","keyboardPitchClasses":[5,9,0],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C","canonical":"C","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,4,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"We had a plan, move out of this town, baby","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"West to the sand, it's all we talked about lately","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"I'd pack the car, brin' your guitar and Jane for smokin'","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"First thing at dawn, you'd cue the songs and we'd get goin'","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"But you weren't home, waited on the porch for ya","columns":48,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Sat there alone, all throughout the morn 'til I","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"Got a hunch down in the gut and snuck around the back","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Empty cans, and I'll be damned, your shit was never packed","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"Did your boots stop workin'?","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"Did your truck break down? (Truck break down)","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"Did you burn through money?","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Did your ex find out? (Ex find out)","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Where there's a will, then there's a way","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm damn sure you lost it","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Didn't even say goodbye","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Just wish I knew what caused it","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Was the whiskey flowin'?","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"Were you in a fight? (In a fight)","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Did the nerves come get you?","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"What's your alibi? (Alibi)","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"I made my way back to LA","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"And that's where you'll be forgotten","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"In 40 years you'll still be here","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Drunk washed up in Austin","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"instrumental","text":"","columns":8,"beats":5,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":4,"beat":1},{"symbol":"G","column":7,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"A hell of a bluff, you had me believin'","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"How many months did you plan on leavin'?","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"What happened? Bad habits?","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"Did you go back? Go batshit?","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"I loved you, how tragic, oh-oh","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"Did your boots stop workin'?","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"Did your truck break down? (Truck break down)","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"Did you burn through money?","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"Did your ex find out? (Ex find out)","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"Where there's a will, then there's a way","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm damn sure you lost it","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"Didn't even say goodbye","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"Just wish I knew what caused it","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id"